# Decouple Workflow and Project Creation

The goal is to move the workflow-to-project mapping logic from the workflow creation service to the project creation service. This allows workflows to be created independently of projects, and associations to be established when a project is initialized.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - `workflow_steps.project_id` will be **REMOVED** from the database schema.
> - `workflowIds` will be supported in the project creation request (as an array) to establish mappings.

